---
const { lang = 'en' } = Astro.props;
const zh = lang === 'zh';

const items = [
  {
    labelEn: 'Accommodation',
    labelZh: '住宿',
    noteEn: '4–5★ hotel, shared double room',
    noteZh: '4–5星酒店，双人间',
    amount: 800,
    pct: 30,
  },
  {
    labelEn: 'Food & dining',
    labelZh: '餐饮',
    noteEn: 'Local specialty restaurants daily',
    noteZh: '每日特色餐厅',
    amount: 700,
    pct: 26,
  },
  {
    labelEn: 'Activities & tickets',
    labelZh: '活动与门票',
    noteEn: 'Entrance fees + special programming',
    noteZh: '景点门票及特色活动',
    amount: 500,
    pct: 18,
  },
  {
    labelEn: 'Guide & local transport',
    labelZh: '导游及市内交通',
    noteEn: 'Professional guide + daily in-city',
    noteZh: '专业导游及每日市内交通',
    amount: 500,
    pct: 18,
  },
  {
    labelEn: 'City-to-city transfers',
    labelZh: '城市间交通',
    noteEn: 'High-speed rail & domestic flights',
    noteZh: '高铁及国内航班',
    amount: 200,
    pct: 8,
  },
];
---

<section class="price-breakdown">
  <div class="price-breakdown__inner">

    <div class="price-breakdown__copy">
      <p class="price-breakdown__eyebrow">{zh ? '关于价格' : 'About the price'}</p>
      <h2 class="price-breakdown__title">
        {zh ? 'CAD $3,000，钱花在了哪里' : 'CAD $3,000 — here\'s where it goes'}
      </h2>
      <div class="price-breakdown__body">
        {zh ? (
          <>
            <p>你或许能找到同价位、甚至更便宜的中国行程。但我们想做的，不是那种普通的旅行。</p>
            <p>你要飞到地球另一端。既然来了，就值得认真对待——不只是景点，还有游戏、派对、深夜美食、手工艺体验，以及真正与当地人相处的时间。</p>
            <p>这些都有成本。但这正是重点所在。</p>
            <strong>我们希望你离开时带走的是回忆，而不是遗憾。</strong>
          </>
        ) : (
          <>
            <p>You could find a similar itinerary for the same price. Maybe cheaper. But that kind of trip isn't what we're building.</p>
            <p>You're flying to the other side of the world. If you're making that trip, make it count — not just the views, but games, parties, local food nights, craft workshops, hanging out with people who actually live there.</p>
            <p>That costs something. But that's exactly the point.</p>
            <strong>We designed this so you leave with memories, not regrets.</strong>
          </>
        )}
      </div>
      <p class="price-breakdown__disclaimer">
        {zh ? '✈ 国际往返机票不含在内' : '✈ International flights not included'}
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="price-breakdown__bars">
      {items.map(item => (
        <div class="price-bar">
          <div class="price-bar__labels">
            <span class="price-bar__name">{zh ? item.labelZh : item.labelEn}</span>
            <span class="price-bar__amount">~${item.amount}</span>
          </div>
          <p class="price-bar__note">{zh ? item.noteZh : item.noteEn}</p>
          <div class="price-bar__track">
            <div class="price-bar__fill" style={`width: ${item.pct}%`}></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      ))}
      <div class="price-bar__total">
        <span>{zh ? '合计（不含机票）' : 'Total (excl. flights)'}</span>
        <span>~$2,700</span>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
